# Budget totals of the generated parsers with budget controls: budget, context polls and result
# of each input and entry, by group, case and input. Not a limit: stage 3 optimizations move the totals.
# A run checks every entry of its scope: an entry that is missing, stale or different fails. -update replaces the
# entries of the scope, drops stale ones and logs a summary per case. Review the diff: it is a regression freeze.
# One line for each case, then for each part of it: the number of entries, the first 10 hex digits of the SHA-256 of
# the sorted "key<TAB>value" lines of those entries and, for a golden of totals, the sums of the two totals. A
# failing run prints the actual entries of the part whose number or digest differs.
